                  <div class="flow-breakdown">
                    <div><span class="flow-dot" style="background:#7c5cfc"></span><span>💼 作業</span><span>¥2,728</span><span>68%</span></div>
                    <div><span class="flow-dot" style="background:#e50914"></span><span>🎬 動画</span><span>¥990</span><span>25%</span></div>
                    <div><span class="flow-dot" style="background:#1db954"></span><span>🎵 音楽</span><span>¥980</span><span>25%</span></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flow-trial-card">
                    <div class="flow-trial-card-top">
                      <span>💼</span>
                      <div>
                        <strong>Adobe CC</strong>
                        <small>無料トライアル — 残り12日</small>
                      </div>
                      <span class="flow-trial-remain">残り12日</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flow-trial-bar"><div class="flow-trial-bar-fill" style="width:60%"></div></div>
                    <small class="flow-trial-note">終了後 ¥2,728/月 の請求が始まります</small>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flow-insight">
                    <span>💡</span>
                    <p>3件のサービスを登録中。年間¥47,736を払っています。</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 設定 -->
                <div class="phone-view" data-flow-view="settings" hidden>
                  <header class="screen-header flow-screen-header"><div><span>Flow</span><h2>設定</h2></div><button type="button" class="round-button flow-round-btn" data-flow-to-home aria-label="ホームへ戻る"><MaterialIcon name="close" /></button></header>
                  <div class="settings-group flow-settings-group">
                    <p>クレジットカード</p>
                    <button type="button"><span>三井住友カード</span><MaterialIcon name="chevron_right" /></button>
                    <button type="button"><span>楽天カード</span><MaterialIcon name="chevron_right" /></button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="settings-group flow-settings-group" style="margin-top:14px">
                    <p>このデモについて</p>
                    <span>入力内容はこのブラウザだけに保存されます。</span>
                    <button type="button" id="reset-flow-demo"><span>デモを初期化する</span><MaterialIcon name="restart_alt" /></button>
                  </div>
